  "key_assumptions": [
    {
      "assumption": "The emergent capabilities of frontier AI models are fundamentally unpredictable via static, pre-deployment testing.",
      "if_wrong": "If static testing could reliably predict future emergent risks, I would support a rigorous, evidence-based audit framework rather than relying solely on post-deployment liability."
